{"type":"message","id":"cb7999ce","parentId":"76b0013f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:45:16.364Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_AY89a18P3dZsjFHPlNq1wqDvNvdFHbDnzq3fMSB0v0OZFu64aHAe-sIyrmKU2IeXaOykodp8LJ-Sf5RK1rsPHoFCQt09bhD_GIrtY0TzRbGkRYQPU-uiXzq_-7gWyfiYCH1i1mJmcoS4FdQKd1Ey-CU98TdQm6aATVncUiWwCYfTKc-9ZQ3ax-6RuyIvVoMxUk0wWX86arUyYGgp-VG7B2JMa5HRNJ_p9WGFV0riLZJREdM6nhDaCoN99FMNVgx1CEyvueYdHNKU7eT7DsH-rndyVcarWeSaa7SdP2CF7dTVf8dSpw8gV4CuqnOoMqdekTDO5xrFbFb5LVprngJGqN7pO1PvitA9WdrwUhBdzDnDSZ1ZtEuWpaCBLvkEewugw2BIjOft41CaOjbCVI49dtWAMIq3bhN9pWNhW5QQXOD4ZKL7Zi0AR88HFvAW5z9Bg7_6ckoT9XnpB_NSyysWrRWGuqedQglpb3Vf0PdDm3VUGk9X_fbwBL8ct0Qr80dv_LsM6zF4S-9n6vLRrOt3PuMgZG-H3F2hQGv-hoDF7_p-7nkY3OKZLyzEPgc6u4R8f5pfGOYNUYgwryuDZL97EISFcNjk1H5yzrkJmzprcwrDgbtZKRybYwcaqE8RT5rNfSgHfFq7Xe9pPmp4vsud009aaZ-EEh5bC65IC0oNRqUJceKIAP3P9ShJPl6N2Qzfe1PEfj_TEazj9iBox2Ne60yTvOqFZ_9podQ_D1Pyf0_KveaxNL0g84Vka2ZdJcZV9NhFiZIU3ebL1uEHBjMSTIUX7UkwMnAEQkGfplx01dOBZ47UZB1hoOFtYirAq4GZ9x0DsW6rJtpr_valydQalLVOS8sYHphjlPwO2Smrz5uDiF7oeYPmSamPVG_7J356aRIjkVQ9r149IVy9A5BdK2nr2_fsYC6K8zBkF-07YY71FaQ3njvO4aru9MjqcGsEr9PFKqqm_pmK9qLsO5q1y7fXA4D_3VyhpUHmyz8078P9Clg79JehfRdI4LzbRhb_z8kRz0AqKT73fzeiG4suBcxht1f2nKhaMMyQO_E12SrryYrVidb3wipAPsVIai_xEIGVgc9y-PPzuymskIMKKAN5m3GowUcrsg","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: gog drive (drv) upload <localPath> [flags]\nBuild: v0.13.0 (5cd913e)\n\nUpload a file\n\nArguments:\n  <localPath>    Path to local file\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help                     Show context-sensitive help.\n      --color=\"auto\"             Color output: auto|always|never\n  -a, --account=STRING           Account email for API commands\n                                 (gmail/calendar/chat/classroom/drive/docs/slides/contacts/tasks/people/sheets/forms/appscript/ads)\n      --client=\"\"                OAuth client name (selects stored credentials +\n                                 token bucket)\n      --access-token=STRING      Use provided access token directly (bypasses\n                                 stored refresh tokens; token expires in ~1h)\n                                 ($GOG_ACCESS_TOKEN)\n      --enable-commands=\"\"       Comma-separated list of enabled commands;\n                                 dot paths allowed (restricts CLI)\n      --disable-commands=\"\"      Comma-separated list of disabled commands;\n                                 dot paths allowed\n      --gmail-no-send            Block Gmail send operations (agent safety)\n  -j, --json                     Output JSON to stdout (best for scripting)\n  -p, --plain                    Output stable, parseable text to stdout (TSV;\n                                 no colors)\n      --results-only             In JSON mode, emit only the primary result\n                                 (drops envelope fields like nextPageToken)\n      --select=STRING            In JSON mode, select comma-separated fields\n                                 (best-effort; supports dot paths). Desire path:\n                                 use --fields for most commands.\n  -n, --dry-run                  Do not make changes; print intended actions and\n                                 exit successfully\n  -y, --force                    Skip confirmations for destructive commands\n      --no-input                 Never prompt; fail instead (useful for CI)\n  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose logging\n      --version                  Print version and exit\n\n      --name=STRING              Override filename (create) or rename target\n                                 (replace)\n      --parent=STRING            Destination folder ID (create only)\n      --replace=STRING           Replace the content of an existing Drive file\n                                 ID (preserves shared link/permissions)\n      --mime-type=STRING         Override MIME type inference\n      --keep-revision-forever    Keep the new head revision forever (binary\n                                 files only)\n      --convert                  Auto-convert to native Google format based on\n                                 file extension (create only)\n      --convert-to=STRING        Convert to a specific Google format:\n                                 doc|sheet|slides (create only)\n      --keep-frontmatter         Keep YAML frontmatter (---) in Markdown when\n                                 converting to a Google Doc (--convert or\n                                 --convert-to doc; default: strip)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":136,"aggregated":"Usage: gog drive (drv) upload <localPath> [flags]\nBuild: v0.13.0 (5cd913e)\n\nUpload a file\n\nArguments:\n  <localPath>    Path to local file\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help                     Show context-sensitive help.\n      --color=\"auto\"             Color output: auto|always|never\n  -a, --account=STRING           Account email for API commands\n                                 (gmail/calendar/chat/classroom/drive/docs/slides/contacts/tasks/people/sheets/forms/appscript/ads)\n      --client=\"\"                OAuth client name (selects stored credentials +\n                                 token bucket)\n      --access-token=STRING      Use provided access token directly (bypasses\n                                 stored refresh tokens; token expires in ~1h)\n                                 ($GOG_ACCESS_TOKEN)\n      --enable-commands=\"\"       Comma-separated list of enabled commands;\n                                 dot paths allowed (restricts CLI)\n      --disable-commands=\"\"      Comma-separated list of disabled commands;\n                                 dot paths allowed\n      --gmail-no-send            Block Gmail send operations (agent safety)\n  -j, --json                     Output JSON to stdout (best for scripting)\n  -p, --plain                    Output stable, parseable text to stdout (TSV;\n                                 no colors)\n      --results-only             In JSON mode, emit only the primary result\n                                 (drops envelope fields like nextPageToken)\n      --select=STRING            In JSON mode, select comma-separated fields\n                                 (best-effort; supports dot paths). Desire path:\n                                 use --fields for most commands.\n  -n, --dry-run                  Do not make changes; print intended actions and\n                                 exit successfully\n  -y, --force                    Skip confirmations for destructive commands\n      --no-input                 Never prompt; fail instead (useful for CI)\n  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose logging\n      --version                  Print version and exit\n\n      --name=STRING              Override filename (create) or rename target\n                                 (replace)\n      --parent=STRING            Destination folder ID (create only)\n      --replace=STRING           Replace the content of an existing Drive file\n                                 ID (preserves shared link/permissions)\n      --mime-type=STRING         Override MIME type inference\n      --keep-revision-forever    Keep the new head revision forever (binary\n                                 files only)\n      --convert                  Auto-convert to native Google format based on\n                                 file extension (create only)\n      --convert-to=STRING        Convert to a specific Google format:\n                                 doc|sheet|slides (create only)\n      --keep-frontmatter         Keep YAML frontmatter (---) in Markdown when\n                                 converting to a Google Doc (--convert or\n                                 --convert-to doc; default: strip)","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780562716364}}
